---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BookingForm from '../components/BookingForm.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Booking Session — CL Potret"
  description="Booking sesi fotografi CL Potret dengan mudah. Pilih layanan, tanggal, lokasi, lalu konfirmasi melalui WhatsApp."
>
  <header class="booking-hero container-wide">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Booking session · Malang</p>
      <h1 class="display">Ceritakan rencanamu,<br/><em>kami bantu sisanya.</em></h1>
    </div>
    <p>Isi detail yang sudah kamu tahu. Setelah dikirim, WhatsApp akan terbuka dengan pesan yang sudah tersusun—belum ada pembayaran di tahap ini.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="booking-layout container-wide">
    <aside>
      <div class="sticky-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Alur booking</p>
        <ol>
          <li><span>01</span><div><strong>Pilih sesi & paket</strong><p>Estimasi harga akan muncul otomatis.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>02</span><div><strong>Tentukan rencana</strong><p>Masukkan tanggal, jam, dan lokasi pilihan.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>03</span><div><strong>Lanjut ke WhatsApp</strong><p>Kami akan cek jadwal sebelum booking dikonfirmasi.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="help">
          <span aria-hidden="true">?</span>
          <p><strong>Belum tahu pilih yang mana?</strong><br/>Lihat perbandingan layanan terlebih dahulu.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/services" class="link-line">Lihat services</a>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <section class="form-card" aria-label="Form booking sesi foto">
      <div class="form-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Form booking</p><h2 class="display">Mulai dari sini.</h2></div>
        <span>± 2 menit</span>
      </div>
      <BookingForm />
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="after-booking">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <p class="eyebrow">Setelah form dikirim</p>
      <div class="after-grid">
        <h2 class="display">Santai, belum langsung terikat.</h2>
        <p>Kami akan membalas melalui WhatsApp untuk memastikan jadwal, menyelaraskan konsep, dan menjelaskan detail pembayaran. Booking baru dianggap terkonfirmasi setelah kamu menyetujuinya.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .booking-hero{padding:clamp(9rem,14vw,13rem) 0 clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:clamp(3rem,8vw,9rem);align-items:end}.booking-hero h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,7.5vw,7.7rem);margin:1.2rem 0 0}.booking-hero h1 em{color:#9a7658;font-weight:400}.booking-hero>p{color:#68645d;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 .5rem;max-width:34rem}
  .booking-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,.65fr) minmax(0,1.35fr);gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,5.5rem);align-items:start;padding-bottom:clamp(6rem,10vw,10rem)}.sticky-card{position:sticky;top:7rem;background:#d8cdbd;padding:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.8rem)}ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:2rem 0}li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.5rem 1fr;gap:.8rem;border-top:1px solid #1d1c1938;padding:1.25rem 0}li>span{font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.1em}li strong{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:400}li p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.55;color:#68645d}.help{display:flex;gap:.8rem;align-items:flex-start;border-top:1px solid #1d1c1938;padding-top:1.3rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem}.help>span{width:1.7rem;height:1.7rem;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid #1d1c1950;border-radius:50%;font-size:.72rem}.help p{font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.55;margin:0;color:#68645d}.help strong{color:#1d1c19}
  .form-card{background:#fffdf8;border:1px solid #1d1c1917;padding:clamp(1.4rem,4vw,4rem);box-shadow:0 24px 70px #372d2010}.form-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;align-items:start;border-bottom:1px solid #1d1c1924;padding-bottom:2rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.form-heading h2{font-size:clamp(3rem,5vw,5rem);margin:.8rem 0 0}.form-heading>span{font-size:.65rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#777268;border:1px solid #1d1c1928;border-radius:999px;padding:.55rem .8rem;white-space:nowrap}
  .after-booking{background:#1d1c19;color:#f3f0e9;padding:clamp(4.5rem,8vw,8rem) 0}.after-booking .eyebrow{color:#ffffff88}.after-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:clamp(3rem,8vw,9rem);align-items:end}.after-grid h2{font-size:clamp(3.2rem,6vw,6rem);margin:1.3rem 0 0}.after-grid p{color:#ffffffa8;line-height:1.8;margin:0;max-width:34rem}
  @media(max-width:900px){.booking-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.booking-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sticky-card{position:relative;top:auto}.sticky-card ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem}.sticky-card li{grid-template-columns:1fr}.after-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  @media(max-width:650px){.booking-hero{padding-top:8rem;min-width:0;overflow:hidden}.booking-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.2rem,13vw,4.4rem)}.booking-hero>p{width:calc(100vw - 2rem);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.booking-layout{width:100%;gap:0}.booking-layout aside{order:2}.sticky-card{padding:2rem 1rem}.sticky-card ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form-card{order:1;min-width:0;border:0}.form-heading{align-items:center}.form-heading h2{font-size:3.3rem}.after-booking{padding-inline:0}}
</style>
